    {
      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "To find the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Convert the cost of the painting from Namibian dollars to US dollars.\n2. Convert the resulting US dollar amount to Chinese yuan.\n\nFirst, we know that:\n\\[ 1 \\text{ US dollar} = 7 \\text{ Namibian dollars} \\]\n\\[ 1 \\text{ US dollar} = 6 \\text{ Chinese yuan} \\]\n\nThe cost of the painting is 105 Namibian dollars. To find out how much this is in US dollars, we use the conversion rate from Namibian dollars to US dollars:\n\\[ \\text{Cost in US dollars} = \\frac{105 \\text{ Namibian dollars}}{7 \\text{ Namibian dollars per US dollar}} = 15 \\text{ US dollars} \\]\n\nNext, we convert this US dollar amount to Chinese yuan. Since 1 US dollar is equivalent to 6 Chinese yuan, we have:\n\\[ \\text{Cost in Chinese yuan} = 15 \\text{ US dollars} \\times 6 \\text{ Chinese yuan per US dollar} = 90 \\text{ Chinese yuan} \\]\n\nTherefore, the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan is:\n\\[ \\boxed{90} \\]",
